OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FMost inland
OL,6,Fareas will be bitterly cold and dry
OL,7,Fwith clear spells. Risk of a few snow
OL,8,Fshowers near the coast during the
OL,9,Fearly hours, these starting to push a
OL,10,Flittle inland around dawn. Breezy.
OL,11,FWidespread frost and icy patches.
OL,12,FMinimum Temperature -4C.
OL,13,
OL,14,CMonday:FSnow showers pushing inland
OL,15,Ffrom the North Sea at first, before
OL,16,Fbecoming confined to coasts later.
OL,17,FOften cloudy to start, sunny spells
OL,18,Fdeveloping in the afternoon. Winds
OL,19,Fslowly easing. Cold. Maximum
OL,20,FTemperature 1C.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page BWeatherCReg Sport FNat Radio
