OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:FSoon
OL,6,Fclouding over Tuesday, with a mixture
OL,7,Fof rain and snow. Sunny spells
OL,8,Fdeveloping Wednesday, before further
OL,9,Fsleet and snow arrives overnight,
OL,10,Fclearing early Thursday, leaving sunny
OL,11,Fspells again.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
